{"unit_id": "tag:06L3:proof", "translation": "这由引理<REF_0001>，以及如下观察推出：态射（morphism）<MATH_0001>就是函子中的群胚（groupoids in functors）的态射（morphism）（因为我们对<MATH_0002>的构造在定义<REF_0002>中是显式给出的）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "groupoids in functors", "target_term": "函子中的群胚"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "范畴态射，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "groupoids in functors", "target_term": "函子中的群胚", "context": "完整复合概念，译法待决"}], "notes": []}
